{"id":"505822","name":"鱼丸粉丝汤","author":"诗心乖乖","authorId":"616135","desc":"","cover":"images/505822/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鱼丸","amount":"12颗"},{"name":"粉丝团","amount":"1个"},{"name":"菠菜","amount":"4棵"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱","amount":"小段"},{"name":"醋","amount":"2-3勺"},{"name":"味极鲜","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"盐","amount":"半勺"},{"name":"油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"花椒","amount":"10粒"},{"name":"胡椒粉","amount":"1勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"肉丸备好","img":"images/505822/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"菠菜提前焯水切段，葱切碎，粉丝泡好","img":"images/505822/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"锅烧热加油，放葱花和花椒爆香","img":"images/505822/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加水烧开，放入鱼丸，加入其他调味料","img":"images/505822/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"鱼丸浮起来，再加入菠菜粉丝煮熟即可。","img":"images/505822/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"出锅后，再根据口味加入1勺醋，太鲜啦。","img":"images/505822/step_6.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}